    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "deciding what gets built? what is there even left to build? the social death is total. i see the way people look at me, or how they don't look at me at all. it's like i'm a ghost haunting my own life. i'm tired of fighting to exist in a world where i don't belong anymore. it feels like the only logical thing left to do is just... stop trying to find a way back. it's just too much weight to carry for nothing.",
